 "profile": {
  "paragraphs": [
   "Economic Impact Catalyst says it serves a variety of economic development and business support organizations. Its platform, Startup Space, is pitched as the single source of truth for an organization's business support programs and activity.",
   "Staff can create application forms, programmatic surveys and intake questionnaires inside the platform. Reports can be formatted in compliance with federal and state funding guidelines. The platform also connects business owners with the expertise they need. For SBDCs, the company says captured information can be exported to Neoserra, Center IC and other common industry software.",
   "Launched in 2018, the company says it now provides over 100 organizations around the country with the software and service they need. The homepage states that more than 200 communities rely on the company, from local chambers of commerce to statewide networks. It describes itself as a SOC 2 compliant provider."
  ],
  "quote": {
   "text": "Support local businesses, record TA, and track economic impact at the most granular level.",
